# MAGIC <div class="dbx">
# MAGIC <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">13</span><span class="sec-icon">📋</span><h2>Requirements and limitations</h2></div><ul>
# MAGIC <li><strong>Unity Catalog</strong> is required. Metric views were introduced in <strong>DBR 16.4</strong>. Agent metadata (spec 1.1) needs <strong>DBR 17.3+</strong>.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Works on <strong>SQL warehouses</strong> and <strong>serverless compute</strong>, which always run a recent version.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Querying: <code>MEASURE()</code> is mandatory, <code>SELECT *</code> is not allowed, and direct joins are not allowed (use a CTE).</li>
# MAGIC <li>Joined tables can't contain <code>MAP</code> columns.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Star joins are <code>LEFT OUTER</code>. With <code>many_to_one</code>, a many-to-many match uses the <strong>first</strong> matching row, so model your keys carefully.</li>
# MAGIC <li><code>rely.at_most_one_match: true</code> is an optimization that is <strong>not validated</strong>. A wrong value causes wrong <code>SUM</code>/<code>COUNT</code>.</li>
# MAGIC <li>Materialization can't be combined with parameters.</li>
# MAGIC </ul>
# MAGIC </div>

